---
name: Sysmon from Fluent Bit Forward → OCSF
description: |
  Receive Sysmon events collected on Windows by Fluent Bit's `winevtlog` input
  over the Fluent Forward protocol and normalize them to OCSF. Configure the
  Windows collector with `event_data_as_map true`, `string_inserts false`, and
  a `forward` output that targets this listener.
---

from_fluent_bit "forward", options={
  listen: "0.0.0.0",
  port: 24224,
}
sysmon::ocsf::normalize
ocsf_derive
ocsf_cast
